/////////////////
// LOCALHOST
////////////////

### CREATE contact (local)
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Michelle",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "email": "msmith@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "04-28-1990"
}

### READ all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### READ single contact by id (local)
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/69f559c6ef036d01fbf74c34

### UPDATE contact (local)
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/69fe5c0a129d0856bfd6f235
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Rachel",
    "lastName": "Richards",
    "email": "rrichards@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "07-02-1984"
}

### DELETE contact (local)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/69fe5c0a129d0856bfd6f235



